body: "The `release` job of the Daily Release workflow failed.\n\n- Failing job: `release`\n- Run URL: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-gantt-chart/actions/runs/39926222453\n- Commit: b0770a49ed1d7d9b28e3c770be0330e9a765cc0d\n- Date (UTC): 2026-10-23T10:00:43Z\n\n\n---\n\n### GitHub comments (1)\n\n> **@unbraind** (2026-10-23T14:39:21Z)\n>\n> Resolved: the 2026-10-23 release PR (#168) merged after the release job's merge wait had expired. A resumed Daily Release (run 39969259950, workflow_dispatch on main) published v2026.10.23 to npm and GitHub. Prevention landed this morning: release PR runs are approved every 5 minutes during the release window and the approve script no longer auto-merges release PRs."
